{"schemaVersion":1,"id":451,"sections":[{"id":"1810001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20577],"start":0,"count":15},{"id":"1810001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20578],"start":15,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:1","scriptId":20577,"text":"菲在空中持续滞留了很久。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:2","scriptId":20577,"text":"“长时间使用翼装，体能有些消耗过度，我得先找个地方休息一会儿。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:3","scriptId":20577,"text":"菲调查战车兽的任务还在继续，她这次锁定了一个战车兽的集群，并已经监视该集群长达一周。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:4","scriptId":20577,"text":"“这群战车兽好像在找什么东西，有点意思。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:5","scriptId":20577,"text":"菲停靠在一处断崖上稍作休息，正当她打算继续观察那些战车兽时，一阵晕眩感向她袭来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:6","scriptId":20577,"text":"“这……难道是消耗太多引起的不良反应？这必须要报告给兰布达她们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:7","scriptId":20577,"text":"正当她还有些晕晕乎乎地时候，战车兽那边好像有了状况。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:8","scriptId":20577,"text":"几只飞行战车兽出现在了战车兽集群的上空。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:9","scriptId":20577,"text":"“嗯？怎么会有飞行战车兽？我刚才怎么没看到。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:10","scriptId":20577,"text":"正当菲还在纳闷为什么飞行战车兽会突然出现时，一阵弹雨从天而降。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:13","scriptId":20577,"text":"“什么！？怎么会这样！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:14","scriptId":20577,"text":"愣了几秒之后菲才意识到自己受到了攻击，抬头一看，有好几头飞行战车兽正盘旋在自己的头上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:15","scriptId":20577,"text":"“有意思，原来被监视的人是我吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:16","scriptId":20577,"text":"虽然晕眩感还没有退去，但菲仍旧强行展开翼装一跃而起。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-PROLOGUE:20577:17","scriptId":20577,"text":"“被你们骑到头上来了，我要把你们碎尸万段！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:1","scriptId":20578,"text":"菲清理完对自己发动突然袭击的那几头战车兽，回到了刚才自己停靠的山崖上——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:2","scriptId":20578,"text":"在战斗上花费的时间并不多，即使是突发情况菲也自认为可以轻松解决。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:3","scriptId":20578,"text":"但紧接着，她便发现自己追踪了一周的战车兽群已经消失的无影无踪。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:4","scriptId":20578,"text":"“什么！？这怎么可能！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:5","scriptId":20578,"text":"“难道刚才的战斗只是诱饵？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:6","scriptId":20578,"text":"“这群杂碎的智商可以啊，竟然还懂声东击西。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:7","scriptId":20578,"text":"一想到浪费了一周的时间而毫无成果，菲就感到无比的沮丧。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:8","scriptId":20578,"text":"菲的牙齿咬得嘎嘎作响，她能感觉到比刚才更加汹涌的愤怒正在从心底冒出，但这回已经没有目标供她发泄了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:9","scriptId":20578,"text":"“很好，看来我需要一些帮手……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:10","scriptId":20578,"text":"菲也没有继续寻找那些消失的战车兽群。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1810001-EPILOGUE:20578:11","scriptId":20578,"text":"在原地休息片刻之后，她头也不回地飞离这片区域开始返回旅行者的基地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-10.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
